    "What is the objective of this production plan — for example, maximizing the number of complete products (each requiring one of each component) that can be produced, maximizing total profit (if so, what are the per-component or per-product profit values), or something else?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice (the objective function). Although it includes a conditional sub-clause about profit values, that information is only required if the user selects 'maximizing total profit,' making it part of the same single decision rather than an independent question."
}

